  "description": "A lightweight, dependency-free collection of high-performance extension methods for modern .NET. 68 methods across string, DateTime, numeric, Guid and collection types: ToSlug, Truncate, NormalizeWhitespace, RemoveSpecialCharacters, Left, Right, Reverse, Capitalize, ToTitleCase, ToCamelCase, ToPascalCase, ToSnakeCase, ToKebabCase, IsPalindrome, ContainsIgnoreCase, EqualsIgnoreCase, Mask, MaskEmail, MaskPhone, MaskCreditCard, StartOfDay, EndOfDay, StartOfWeek, EndOfWeek, StartOfMonth, EndOfMonth, IsWeekend, GetAge, ToHumanTime, Clamp, InRange, IsEven, IsOdd, ToPercentage, ToReadableFileSize, ToOrdinal, IsNullOrEmpty, IsNotEmpty, None, HasDuplicates, Shuffle, DistinctBy, Chunk, Batch, Page and PageBy — every method argument-validated, fully XML-documented, and covered by 770 tests on every target framework. Multi-targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. Trim- and Native AOT-safe, with zero transitive dependencies.",
